<deviceset name="DISP_PSP_LCDCON" prefix="CN" uservalue="yes">
<description>&lt;p&gt;Sharp LQ043xx/PSP 24-Bit LCD Display&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;UPPER&lt;/b&gt; - FPC Connector w/Upper Contacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;BOTTOM&lt;/b&gt; - FPC Connector w/Bottom Contacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use the &lt;b&gt;UPPER&lt;/b&gt; connector if the LCD connector is on one side of the board and the LCD will be wrapped around the edge onto the other side of the board (which is what normally happens).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use the &lt;b&gt;BOTTOM&lt;/b&gt; connector if the LCD and the connector are on the same side of the board (the cable with be folded directly underneath the LCD).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
