<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;MCP130T Voltage Supervisor (Active Low)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Voltage supervisors will put the MCU in a reset state if the voltage drops below a pre-determined level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;SOT23-R/SOT23-W:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voltage Supervisor - 3.15V Active Low&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: Use the "Reflow" footprint when working with solder paste, and the "Wave" footprint when soldering by hand with a soldering iron (the latter has larger pads that are easier to solder by hand).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digikey: MCP130T-315I/TTCT-ND&lt;/p&gt;</description>
