<deviceset name="MAX6364" prefix="U" uservalue="yes">
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;MAX6364 - Low Power Voltage Supervisor (3.08V) with Battery Backup&lt;/&lt;b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This 'battery backup supervisor' will supply up to 150mA of current from VCC.  If VCC ever drops below the 3.08V threshold, the supervisor will automatically switch the power supply to battery power, allowing you to safely 'fall-back' on a secondary power source for critical applications, or where you know that the main power suppy is inherently volatile (solar panels, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digikey: MAX6364LUT31+TCT-ND&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<gates>
<gate name="G$1" symbol="MAX6364" x="0" y="-2.54"/>
