<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;LDO Fixed Voltage Regulator 150mA&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The LD39015xx voltage regulator is ideal for regulating battery or solar power due to it's very low foreward voltage drop (~100mV at 150mA).&lt;/p&gt;
Forward Voltage Dropout: 100mV at 150mA, 80mV at 100mA&lt;br/&gt;
Input Voltage Range: 1.5V-5.5V&lt;br/&gt;
Output Voltage Range: 0.8V-3.3V (depending on model)
&lt;p&gt;Digikey: 1.8V - 497-6977-1-ND&lt;/p&gt;</description>
